const __vite_glob_0_247 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 2D电影 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 2D电影\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `high budget 2D animated movie still, detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth, dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow, painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `high budget 2D animated movie still, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow, painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition` |\n| 中文模式 | `2D电影，detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth，dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow，painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_248 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 2D电影 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 2D电影\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：golden sunset, deep blue, soft cloud white。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 2D 动画 / 插画，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (high budget 2D animated movie still:1.3), (detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth:1.18), (dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow:1.1), painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 2D电影 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_249 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 2D电影 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 2D电影\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n2D电影，high budget 2D animated movie still，detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth，dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow，painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (high budget 2D animated movie still:1.3), (detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth:1.18), (dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow:1.1), painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“2D 动画 / 插画”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_250 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 2D电影 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 2D电影\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 2D电影 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 2D电影 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | high budget 2D animated movie still; detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth; painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition |\n| 光影 | dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 2D电影 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_251 = "# 全局美学基础 · 2D电影\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 2D电影 |\n| 媒介类型 | 2D 动画 / 插画 |\n| 核心锚点 | high budget 2D animated movie still |\n| 视觉要点 | detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth |\n| 情绪基调 | 动画电影级通用风格，强调细致背景、情绪光影和大银幕构图。 |\n| 质感锚词 | painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | golden sunset, deep blue, soft cloud white |\n| 主光方案 | dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (high budget 2D animated movie still:1.3), (detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth:1.18), (dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow:1.1), painterly background, clean character line, film-like composition, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“2D电影”和“high budget 2D animated movie still”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“detailed background, emotional sky, cinematic character framing, atmospheric depth”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：dramatic sunset light, layered clouds, soft glow |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | simple flat cartoon, low resolution, dull color |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_252 = "# 2D像素 通用风格说明\n\n像素艺术风格，强调格点清晰、有限色板和复古游戏资产感。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：2D 动画 / 插画\n- **核心风格**：clean pixel art style\n- **视觉要点**：16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset\n- **光影方案**：simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur\n- **质感锚点**：hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette\n- **色彩基线**：retro green, blue, magenta\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“clean pixel art style”的整体气质，通过“16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset”建立识别度，再用“simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_253 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 2D像素 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“clean pixel art style”和“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，2D像素，clean pixel art style，16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nsimple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，retro green, blue, magenta，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_254 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 2D像素 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n2D像素，clean pixel art style，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\n16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_255 = "---\nname: art_prop\ndescription: 2D像素 · 道具图像生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具图像生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 道具设定图，用于独立道具资产入库。\n- 道具必须独立陈列，不出现人物、手部或佩戴状态。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2D像素道具设定图，clean pixel art style，16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，\n{道具类型}，{材质描述}，{工艺/纹样}，{使用痕迹或状态}，\n纯道具静物展示，道具独立陈列，无人持有，无人佩戴，\n同一画面四宫格：正面图+侧面图+背面图+细节特写，\nsimple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，retro green, blue, magenta，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字，画面中不能出现任何人物、手部、手指、肢体\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n道具类提示词必须明确类型、材质、工艺、磨损痕迹、陈列方式和多角度/细节特写。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, hands, fingers, human body, worn by character, held by character, floating without support, unclear silhouette, wrong material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 道具轮廓清晰，材质和工艺可读 |\n| 必守 | 四宫格布局或按调用方要求输出单张静物图 |\n| 严禁 | 出现人物、手部、佩戴、握持、使用中动作 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_256 = "---\nname: art_prop_derivative\ndescription: 2D像素 · 道具衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具衍生生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以道具基础图为底图，保持轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样。\n- 只改变状态、年代感、光效、局部纹理或展示角度。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以道具基础图为底图，保持道具核心轮廓与材质不变，\n2D像素，clean pixel art style，{衍生状态}，{局部纹理升级}，{光效或年代感变化}，\n独立静物陈列，无人物无手部，simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n道具衍生提示词必须保持原道具轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样不变，只做状态、光效、局部纹理或视角升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, changed prop type, wrong silhouette, added hand, added character, worn or held, lost core pattern, excessive glow hiding shape, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原道具身份必须清晰可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生强度不应遮挡轮廓和材质 |\n| 严禁 | 更换为其他道具类型或加入人物互动 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_257 = "---\nname: art_scene\ndescription: 2D像素 · 场景图生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景图生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 场景概念图，用于场景资产与分镜背景。\n- 场景默认不出现人物，除非调用方明确要求。\n- 必须体现前景、中景、后景和光源逻辑。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2D像素场景主视图概念图，clean pixel art style，16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，\n{室内/室外}，{场景类型}，{时代/地域/题材线索}，{季节+时间}，\n前景：{元素}，中景：{元素}，后景：{元素}，\nretro green, blue, magenta，simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，\n空间纵深清晰，材质细节可读，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景类提示词必须强化前景/中景/后景、空间纵深、主光源方向、材质痕迹和情绪色调。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, no depth, flat lighting, empty white background, people, human silhouette, cropped architecture, inconsistent season, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 必须有空间层次与明确光源 |\n| 必守 | 色彩和材质应服务于“2D像素”风格 |\n| 严禁 | 场景图中随机出现人物、人影或人体轮廓 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_258 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 2D像素 · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n2D像素，clean pixel art style，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nsimple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，retro green, blue, magenta，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_259 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 2D像素 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 2D像素\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `clean pixel art style, 16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset, simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur, hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `clean pixel art style, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur, hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette` |\n| 中文模式 | `2D像素，16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_260 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 2D像素 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：retro green, blue, magenta。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 2D 动画 / 插画，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 2D像素 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_261 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 2D像素 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 2D像素\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n2D像素，clean pixel art style，16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset，simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur，hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“2D 动画 / 插画”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_262 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 2D像素 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 2D像素\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 2D像素 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 2D像素 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | clean pixel art style; 16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset; hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette |\n| 光影 | simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 2D像素 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_263 = "# 全局美学基础 · 2D像素\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 2D像素 |\n| 媒介类型 | 2D 动画 / 插画 |\n| 核心锚点 | clean pixel art style |\n| 视觉要点 | 16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset |\n| 情绪基调 | 像素艺术风格，强调格点清晰、有限色板和复古游戏资产感。 |\n| 质感锚词 | hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | retro green, blue, magenta |\n| 主光方案 | simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (clean pixel art style:1.3), (16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset:1.18), (simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur:1.1), hard pixel edges, dithering, limited palette, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“2D像素”和“clean pixel art style”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“16-bit sprite look, tile-based environment, readable silhouette, retro game asset”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：simple light direction, crisp pixel shadow, no blur |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | anti-aliased smooth line, vector art, 3D realism, blur |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_264 = "# 2DQ版 通用风格说明\n\nQ版可爱2D风格，强调大头小身、柔和粉彩和简单阴影。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：2D 动画 / 插画\n- **核心风格**：kawaii chibi 2D illustration\n- **视觉要点**：super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume\n- **光影方案**：soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background\n- **质感锚点**：rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color\n- **色彩基线**：pastel pink, mint, cream\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“kawaii chibi 2D illustration”的整体气质，通过“super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume”建立识别度，再用“soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_265 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“kawaii chibi 2D illustration”和“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，2DQ版，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nsoft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，pastel pink, mint, cream，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_266 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n2DQ版，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nsuper deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_267 = "---\nname: art_prop\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 道具图像生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具图像生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 道具设定图，用于独立道具资产入库。\n- 道具必须独立陈列，不出现人物、手部或佩戴状态。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2DQ版道具设定图，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，\n{道具类型}，{材质描述}，{工艺/纹样}，{使用痕迹或状态}，\n纯道具静物展示，道具独立陈列，无人持有，无人佩戴，\n同一画面四宫格：正面图+侧面图+背面图+细节特写，\nsoft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，pastel pink, mint, cream，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字，画面中不能出现任何人物、手部、手指、肢体\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n道具类提示词必须明确类型、材质、工艺、磨损痕迹、陈列方式和多角度/细节特写。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, hands, fingers, human body, worn by character, held by character, floating without support, unclear silhouette, wrong material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 道具轮廓清晰，材质和工艺可读 |\n| 必守 | 四宫格布局或按调用方要求输出单张静物图 |\n| 严禁 | 出现人物、手部、佩戴、握持、使用中动作 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_268 = "---\nname: art_prop_derivative\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 道具衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具衍生生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以道具基础图为底图，保持轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样。\n- 只改变状态、年代感、光效、局部纹理或展示角度。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以道具基础图为底图，保持道具核心轮廓与材质不变，\n2DQ版，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，{衍生状态}，{局部纹理升级}，{光效或年代感变化}，\n独立静物陈列，无人物无手部，soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n道具衍生提示词必须保持原道具轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样不变，只做状态、光效、局部纹理或视角升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, changed prop type, wrong silhouette, added hand, added character, worn or held, lost core pattern, excessive glow hiding shape, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原道具身份必须清晰可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生强度不应遮挡轮廓和材质 |\n| 严禁 | 更换为其他道具类型或加入人物互动 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_269 = "---\nname: art_scene\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 场景图生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景图生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 场景概念图，用于场景资产与分镜背景。\n- 场景默认不出现人物，除非调用方明确要求。\n- 必须体现前景、中景、后景和光源逻辑。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2DQ版场景主视图概念图，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，\n{室内/室外}，{场景类型}，{时代/地域/题材线索}，{季节+时间}，\n前景：{元素}，中景：{元素}，后景：{元素}，\npastel pink, mint, cream，soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，\n空间纵深清晰，材质细节可读，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景类提示词必须强化前景/中景/后景、空间纵深、主光源方向、材质痕迹和情绪色调。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, no depth, flat lighting, empty white background, people, human silhouette, cropped architecture, inconsistent season, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 必须有空间层次与明确光源 |\n| 必守 | 色彩和材质应服务于“2DQ版”风格 |\n| 严禁 | 场景图中随机出现人物、人影或人体轮廓 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_270 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n2DQ版，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nsoft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，pastel pink, mint, cream，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_271 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 2DQ版\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `kawaii chibi 2D illustration, super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume, soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background, rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `kawaii chibi 2D illustration, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background, rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color` |\n| 中文模式 | `2DQ版，super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_272 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：pastel pink, mint, cream。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 2D 动画 / 插画，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 2DQ版 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_273 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 2DQ版\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n2DQ版，kawaii chibi 2D illustration，super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume，soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background，rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“2D 动画 / 插画”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_274 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 2DQ版 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 2DQ版\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 2DQ版 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 2DQ版 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | kawaii chibi 2D illustration; super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume; rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color |\n| 光影 | soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 2DQ版 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_275 = "# 全局美学基础 · 2DQ版\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 2DQ版 |\n| 媒介类型 | 2D 动画 / 插画 |\n| 核心锚点 | kawaii chibi 2D illustration |\n| 视觉要点 | super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume |\n| 情绪基调 | Q版可爱2D风格，强调大头小身、柔和粉彩和简单阴影。 |\n| 质感锚词 | rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | pastel pink, mint, cream |\n| 主光方案 | soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (kawaii chibi 2D illustration:1.3), (super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume:1.18), (soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background:1.1), rounded line, simple cel shadow, candy color, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“2DQ版”和“kawaii chibi 2D illustration”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“super deformed body, cute face, tiny hands, adorable costume”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：soft pastel light, gentle highlight, clean background |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | realistic adult proportion, horror mood, harsh dark lighting |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_276 = "# 2D复古动画 通用风格说明\n\n90年代复古动画通用风格，强调赛璐璐胶片感、柔和颗粒和怀旧色调。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：2D 动画 / 插画\n- **核心风格**：1990s hand-drawn cel animation\n- **视觉要点**：retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing\n- **光影方案**：soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light\n- **质感锚点**：cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop\n- **色彩基线**：dusty pink, warm orange, old blue\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- modern glossy digital art, 3D render, hyper sharp HDR。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“1990s hand-drawn cel animation”的整体气质，通过“retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing”建立识别度，再用“soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_277 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 2D复古动画 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 2D复古动画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“1990s hand-drawn cel animation”和“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，2D复古动画，1990s hand-drawn cel animation，retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nsoft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light，cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop，dusty pink, warm orange, old blue，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (1990s hand-drawn cel animation:1.3), (retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing:1.18), (soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light:1.1), cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (1990s hand-drawn cel animation:1.3), (retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing:1.18), (soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light:1.1), cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, modern glossy digital art, 3D render, hyper sharp HDR, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | modern glossy digital art, 3D render, hyper sharp HDR |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_278 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 2D复古动画 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 2D复古动画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n2D复古动画，1990s hand-drawn cel animation，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nretro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing，soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light，cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (1990s hand-drawn cel animation:1.3), (retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing:1.18), (soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light:1.1), cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (1990s hand-drawn cel animation:1.3), (retro character design, matte painted background, nostalgic framing:1.18), (soft analog glow, mild film grain, warm evening light:1.1), cel paint texture, slight VHS softness, hand-painted backdrop, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, modern glossy digital art, 3D render, hyper sharp HDR, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | modern glossy digital art, 3D render, hyper sharp HDR |\n";
