const __vite_glob_0_343 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 2D简单线条 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 2D简单线条\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `minimal clean line art, continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition, plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity, thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `minimal clean line art, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity, thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill` |\n| 中文模式 | `2D简单线条，continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition，plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity，thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_344 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 2D简单线条 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 2D简单线条\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：black, white, single accent color。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 2D 动画 / 插画，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimal clean line art:1.3), (continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition:1.18), (plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity:1.1), thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 2D简单线条 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_345 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 2D简单线条 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 2D简单线条\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n2D简单线条，minimal clean line art，continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition，plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity，thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimal clean line art:1.3), (continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition:1.18), (plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity:1.1), thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“2D 动画 / 插画”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_346 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 2D简单线条 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 2D简单线条\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 2D简单线条 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 2D简单线条 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | minimal clean line art; continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition; thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill |\n| 光影 | plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 2D简单线条 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_347 = "# 全局美学基础 · 2D简单线条\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 2D简单线条 |\n| 媒介类型 | 2D 动画 / 插画 |\n| 核心锚点 | minimal clean line art |\n| 视觉要点 | continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition |\n| 情绪基调 | 极简线稿风格，强调连续线、白底和优雅留白。 |\n| 质感锚词 | thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | black, white, single accent color |\n| 主光方案 | plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimal clean line art:1.3), (continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition:1.18), (plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity:1.1), thin black line, vector-like edge, minimal fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“2D简单线条”和“minimal clean line art”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“continuous line drawing, elegant figure, simple object, blank composition”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：plain even light, no heavy shadow, graphic clarity |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | messy sketch, dense background, 3D shading, realism |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_348 = "# 2D运动写实漫画 通用风格说明\n\n运动写实漫画风格，强调真实比例、汗水、肌肉张力和比赛现场感。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：2D 动画 / 插画\n- **核心风格**：realistic sports manga animation\n- **视觉要点**：athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus\n- **光影方案**：gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame\n- **质感锚点**：inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion\n- **色彩基线**：court orange, white, deep red\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“realistic sports manga animation”的整体气质，通过“athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus”建立识别度，再用“gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_349 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 2D运动写实漫画 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 2D运动写实漫画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“realistic sports manga animation”和“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，2D运动写实漫画，realistic sports manga animation，athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\ngymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame，inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion，court orange, white, deep red，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_350 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 2D运动写实漫画 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 2D运动写实漫画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n2D运动写实漫画，realistic sports manga animation，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nathletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus，gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame，inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_351 = "---\nname: art_prop\ndescription: 2D运动写实漫画 · 道具图像生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具图像生成 · 2D运动写实漫画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 道具设定图，用于独立道具资产入库。\n- 道具必须独立陈列，不出现人物、手部或佩戴状态。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2D运动写实漫画道具设定图，realistic sports manga animation，athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus，\n{道具类型}，{材质描述}，{工艺/纹样}，{使用痕迹或状态}，\n纯道具静物展示，道具独立陈列，无人持有，无人佩戴，\n同一画面四宫格：正面图+侧面图+背面图+细节特写，\ngymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame，inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion，court orange, white, deep red，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字，画面中不能出现任何人物、手部、手指、肢体\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (realistic sports manga animation:1.3), (athletic body proportion, sweat detail, court atmosphere, intense eye focus:1.18), (gymnasium top light, hard rim light, action freeze frame:1.1), inked muscle line, textured shading, energetic motion, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n道具类提示词必须明确类型、材质、工艺、磨损痕迹、陈列方式和多角度/细节特写。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy, hands, fingers, human body, worn by character, held by character, floating without support, unclear silhouette, wrong material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 道具轮廓清晰，材质和工艺可读 |\n| 必守 | 四宫格布局或按调用方要求输出单张静物图 |\n| 严禁 | 出现人物、手部、佩戴、握持、使用中动作 |\n| 严禁 | chibi cute body, fantasy robe, weak anatomy |\n";
