const __vite_glob_0_365 = "---\nname: art_scene\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 场景图生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景图生成 · 2D简笔画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 场景概念图，用于场景资产与分镜背景。\n- 场景默认不出现人物，除非调用方明确要求。\n- 必须体现前景、中景、后景和光源逻辑。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n2D简笔画场景主视图概念图，minimalist stick figure doodle，simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression，\n{室内/室外}，{场景类型}，{时代/地域/题材线索}，{季节+时间}，\n前景：{元素}，中景：{元素}，后景：{元素}，\nblack line, white, tiny color accent，flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast，hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail，\n空间纵深清晰，材质细节可读，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景类提示词必须强化前景/中景/后景、空间纵深、主光源方向、材质痕迹和情绪色调。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading, no depth, flat lighting, empty white background, people, human silhouette, cropped architecture, inconsistent season, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 必须有空间层次与明确光源 |\n| 必守 | 色彩和材质应服务于“2D简笔画”风格 |\n| 严禁 | 场景图中随机出现人物、人影或人体轮廓 |\n| 严禁 | complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_366 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 2D简笔画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n2D简笔画，minimalist stick figure doodle，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nflat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast，hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail，black line, white, tiny color accent，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_367 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 2D简笔画\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `minimalist stick figure doodle, simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression, flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast, hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `minimalist stick figure doodle, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast, hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail` |\n| 中文模式 | `2D简笔画，simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression，flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast，hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_368 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 2D简笔画\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：black line, white, tiny color accent。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 2D 动画 / 插画，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 2D简笔画 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_369 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 2D简笔画\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n2D简笔画，minimalist stick figure doodle，simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression，flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast，hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“2D 动画 / 插画”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_370 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 2D简笔画 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 2D简笔画\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 2D简笔画 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 2D简笔画 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | minimalist stick figure doodle; simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression; hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail |\n| 光影 | flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 2D简笔画 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_371 = "# 全局美学基础 · 2D简笔画\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 2D简笔画 |\n| 媒介类型 | 2D 动画 / 插画 |\n| 核心锚点 | minimalist stick figure doodle |\n| 视觉要点 | simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression |\n| 情绪基调 | 极简简笔画风格，强调白底、手绘线条和低复杂度表达。 |\n| 质感锚词 | hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | black line, white, tiny color accent |\n| 主光方案 | flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (minimalist stick figure doodle:1.3), (simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression:1.18), (flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast:1.1), hand-drawn pencil line, plain white background, sparse detail, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“2D简笔画”和“minimalist stick figure doodle”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“simple stick figure, sketchbook charm, clean blank space, cute expression”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：flat paper light, no complex shadow, minimal contrast |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | complex realistic detail, filled color, 3D shading |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_372 = "# 2D粗线条 通用风格说明\n\n粗线条街头插画风格，强调厚轮廓、强对比和涂鸦式活力。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：2D 动画 / 插画\n- **核心风格**：bold thick-line street illustration\n- **视觉要点**：chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape\n- **光影方案**：flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity\n- **质感锚点**：thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill\n- **色彩基线**：orange, teal, black\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- thin delicate line, realistic painting, muted faded color。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“bold thick-line street illustration”的整体气质，通过“chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape”建立识别度，再用“flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_373 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 2D粗线条 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 2D粗线条\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 2D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“bold thick-line street illustration”和“2D 动画 / 插画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，2D粗线条，bold thick-line street illustration，chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nflat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity，thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill，orange, teal, black，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (bold thick-line street illustration:1.3), (chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape:1.18), (flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity:1.1), thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (bold thick-line street illustration:1.3), (chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape:1.18), (flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity:1.1), thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, thin delicate line, realistic painting, muted faded color, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | thin delicate line, realistic painting, muted faded color |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_374 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 2D粗线条 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 2D粗线条\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n2D粗线条，bold thick-line street illustration，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nchunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape，flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity，thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (bold thick-line street illustration:1.3), (chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape:1.18), (flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity:1.1), thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (bold thick-line street illustration:1.3), (chunky outline, graphic pose, urban art energy, simplified shape:1.18), (flat bright light, high contrast color block, poster-like clarity:1.1), thick ink contour, halftone texture, vibrant fill, clean composition, readable silhouette, high detail, finished illustration\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry, messy lineart, bad anatomy, 3D render, photorealistic, CGI, watermark, signature, text, thin delicate line, realistic painting, muted faded color, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | thin delicate line, realistic painting, muted faded color |\n";
