const __vite_glob_0_449 = "---\nname: art_scene\ndescription: 3D美式 · 场景图生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景图生成 · 3D美式\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 3D 场景概念图，用于场景资产与分镜背景。\n- 场景默认不出现人物，除非调用方明确要求。\n- 必须体现前景、中景、后景和光源逻辑。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n3D美式场景主视图概念图，rounded western 3D animation，large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background，\n{室内/室外}，{场景类型}，{时代/地域/题材线索}，{季节+时间}，\n前景：{元素}，中景：{元素}，后景：{元素}，\nsunny amber, sky blue, soft coral，warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight，smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface，\n空间纵深清晰，材质细节可读，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n场景类提示词必须强化前景/中景/后景、空间纵深、主光源方向、材质痕迹和情绪色调。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin, no depth, flat lighting, empty white background, people, human silhouette, cropped architecture, inconsistent season, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 必须有空间层次与明确光源 |\n| 必守 | 色彩和材质应服务于“3D美式”风格 |\n| 严禁 | 场景图中随机出现人物、人影或人体轮廓 |\n| 严禁 | dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_450 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 3D美式 · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 3D美式\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n3D美式，rounded western 3D animation，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nwarm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight，smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface，sunny amber, sky blue, soft coral，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_451 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 3D美式 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 3D美式\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `rounded western 3D animation, large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background, warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight, smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `rounded western 3D animation, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight, smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface` |\n| 中文模式 | `3D美式，large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background，warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight，smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_452 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 3D美式 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 3D美式\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：sunny amber, sky blue, soft coral。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 3D 渲染，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 3D美式 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_453 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 3D美式 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 3D美式\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n3D美式，rounded western 3D animation，large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background，warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight，smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“3D 渲染”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_454 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 3D美式 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 3D美式\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 3D美式 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 3D美式 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | rounded western 3D animation; large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background; smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface |\n| 光影 | warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 3D美式 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_455 = "# 全局美学基础 · 3D美式\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 3D美式 |\n| 媒介类型 | 3D 渲染 |\n| 核心锚点 | rounded western 3D animation |\n| 视觉要点 | large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background |\n| 情绪基调 | 美式家庭动画方向的通用3D风格，强调圆润角色、明快色彩和温暖表情。 |\n| 质感锚词 | smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | sunny amber, sky blue, soft coral |\n| 主光方案 | warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (rounded western 3D animation:1.3), (large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background:1.18), (warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight:1.1), smooth stylized material, soft edges, polished character surface, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“3D美式”和“rounded western 3D animation”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“3D 渲染”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“large expressive eyes, friendly proportions, readable silhouette, colorful town background”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：warm key light, soft fill light, cheerful daylight |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | dark gritty realism, horror mood, hard realistic skin |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_456 = "# 3D块面 通用风格说明\n\n低多边形块面风格，强调几何结构、简洁体块和清晰配色。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：3D 渲染\n- **核心风格**：low poly geometric 3D art\n- **视觉要点**：faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment\n- **光影方案**：clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow\n- **质感锚点**：flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture\n- **色彩基线**：fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“3D 渲染”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“low poly geometric 3D art”的整体气质，通过“faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment”建立识别度，再用“clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_457 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 3D块面 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 3D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“low poly geometric 3D art”和“3D 渲染”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，3D块面，low poly geometric 3D art，faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nclear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_458 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 3D块面 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n3D块面，low poly geometric 3D art，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nfaceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_459 = "---\nname: art_prop\ndescription: 3D块面 · 道具图像生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具图像生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 3D 道具设定图，用于独立道具资产入库。\n- 道具必须独立陈列，不出现人物、手部或佩戴状态。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n3D块面道具设定图，low poly geometric 3D art，faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，\n{道具类型}，{材质描述}，{工艺/纹样}，{使用痕迹或状态}，\n纯道具静物展示，道具独立陈列，无人持有，无人佩戴，\n同一画面四宫格：正面图+侧面图+背面图+细节特写，\nclear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，\n画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字，画面中不能出现任何人物、手部、手指、肢体\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n道具类提示词必须明确类型、材质、工艺、磨损痕迹、陈列方式和多角度/细节特写。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, hands, fingers, human body, worn by character, held by character, floating without support, unclear silhouette, wrong material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 道具轮廓清晰，材质和工艺可读 |\n| 必守 | 四宫格布局或按调用方要求输出单张静物图 |\n| 严禁 | 出现人物、手部、佩戴、握持、使用中动作 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_460 = "---\nname: art_prop_derivative\ndescription: 3D块面 · 道具衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 道具衍生生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以道具基础图为底图，保持轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样。\n- 只改变状态、年代感、光效、局部纹理或展示角度。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以道具基础图为底图，保持道具核心轮廓与材质不变，\n3D块面，low poly geometric 3D art，{衍生状态}，{局部纹理升级}，{光效或年代感变化}，\n独立静物陈列，无人物无手部，clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，画面无字幕、无水印、无标题叠字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n道具衍生提示词必须保持原道具轮廓、核心材质和识别纹样不变，只做状态、光效、局部纹理或视角升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, changed prop type, wrong silhouette, added hand, added character, worn or held, lost core pattern, excessive glow hiding shape, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原道具身份必须清晰可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生强度不应遮挡轮廓和材质 |\n| 严禁 | 更换为其他道具类型或加入人物互动 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_461 = "---\nname: art_scene\ndescription: 3D块面 · 场景图生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景图生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 3D 场景概念图，用于场景资产与分镜背景。\n- 场景默认不出现人物，除非调用方明确要求。\n- 必须体现前景、中景、后景和光源逻辑。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n3D块面场景主视图概念图，low poly geometric 3D art，faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，\n{室内/室外}，{场景类型}，{时代/地域/题材线索}，{季节+时间}，\n前景：{元素}，中景：{元素}，后景：{元素}，\nfresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange，clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，\n空间纵深清晰，材质细节可读，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n场景类提示词必须强化前景/中景/后景、空间纵深、主光源方向、材质痕迹和情绪色调。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, no depth, flat lighting, empty white background, people, human silhouette, cropped architecture, inconsistent season, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 必须有空间层次与明确光源 |\n| 必守 | 色彩和材质应服务于“3D块面”风格 |\n| 严禁 | 场景图中随机出现人物、人影或人体轮廓 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_462 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 3D块面 · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n3D块面，low poly geometric 3D art，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nclear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_463 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 3D块面 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 3D块面\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `low poly geometric 3D art, faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment, clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow, flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `low poly geometric 3D art, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow, flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture` |\n| 中文模式 | `3D块面，faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_464 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 3D块面 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 3D 渲染，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 3D块面 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_465 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 3D块面 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 3D块面\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n3D块面，low poly geometric 3D art，faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment，clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow，flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“3D 渲染”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_466 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 3D块面 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 3D块面\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 3D块面 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 3D块面 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | low poly geometric 3D art; faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment; flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture |\n| 光影 | clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 3D块面 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_467 = "# 全局美学基础 · 3D块面\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 3D块面 |\n| 媒介类型 | 3D 渲染 |\n| 核心锚点 | low poly geometric 3D art |\n| 视觉要点 | faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment |\n| 情绪基调 | 低多边形块面风格，强调几何结构、简洁体块和清晰配色。 |\n| 质感锚词 | flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | fresh green, sky blue, sandstone orange |\n| 主光方案 | clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (low poly geometric 3D art:1.3), (faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment:1.18), (clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow:1.1), flat shaded polygons, crisp edges, minimal texture, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“3D块面”和“low poly geometric 3D art”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“3D 渲染”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“faceted shapes, angular silhouette, simple forms, clean environment”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：clear daylight, simple ambient occlusion, readable shadow |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | high-poly realism, organic smooth shapes, noisy texture |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_468 = "# 3D手游 通用风格说明\n\n手游级风格化3D，强调清爽材质、可读轮廓和高完成度游戏资产。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：3D 渲染\n- **核心风格**：stylized mobile game 3D render\n- **视觉要点**：hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette\n- **光影方案**：bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look\n- **质感锚点**：optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color\n- **色彩基线**：blue sky, fresh green, heroic gold\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“3D 渲染”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- photorealistic noise, rough sketch, pixelated low quality。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“stylized mobile game 3D render”的整体气质，通过“hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette”建立识别度，再用“bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_469 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 3D手游 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 3D手游\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 3D 角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“stylized mobile game 3D render”和“3D 渲染”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，3D手游，stylized mobile game 3D render，hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nbright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look，optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color，blue sky, fresh green, heroic gold，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (stylized mobile game 3D render:1.3), (hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette:1.18), (bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look:1.1), optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (stylized mobile game 3D render:1.3), (hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette:1.18), (bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look:1.1), optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic noise, rough sketch, pixelated low quality, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | photorealistic noise, rough sketch, pixelated low quality |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_470 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 3D手游 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 3D手游\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n3D手游，stylized mobile game 3D render，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nhero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette，bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look，optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (stylized mobile game 3D render:1.3), (hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette:1.18), (bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look:1.1), optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (stylized mobile game 3D render:1.3), (hero character design, clean fantasy outfit, readable game asset silhouette:1.18), (bright outdoor light, soft ambient light, polished game look:1.1), optimized clean material, stylized cloth and metal, vivid but controlled color, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic noise, rough sketch, pixelated low quality, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | photorealistic noise, rough sketch, pixelated low quality |\n";
