const __vite_glob_0_582 = "---\nname: art_scene_derivative\ndescription: 日式3D渲染2D · 场景衍生生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 场景衍生生成 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感和风格边界。\n- 只改变时段、天候、景别、镜头角度或局部氛围。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以场景基础图为底图，保持原场景空间结构和识别地标不变，\n日式3D渲染2D，Japanese cel shaded 3D action render，{时段/天候/景别变化}，{氛围强化}，\nhard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks，crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups，electric blue, black, orange accent，\n前中后景层次保留，单画面构图，画面中无任何人物，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (Japanese cel shaded 3D action render:1.3), (sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose:1.18), (hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks:1.1), crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (Japanese cel shaded 3D action render:1.3), (sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose:1.18), (hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks:1.1), crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n场景衍生提示词必须保持原场景地标、空间结构、材质年代感不变，只改变时段、天候、景别或镜头角度。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness, changed location, lost landmark, added people, random architecture, inconsistent perspective, flat lighting, overclean material, text, watermark.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 原场景身份必须可识别 |\n| 必守 | 衍生变化必须围绕时段、天气、镜头和氛围展开 |\n| 严禁 | 换场景、换世界观、加入无关人物 |\n| 严禁 | photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_583 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 日式3D渲染2D · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `Japanese cel shaded 3D action render, sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose, hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks, crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `Japanese cel shaded 3D action render, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks, crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups` |\n| 中文模式 | `日式3D渲染2D，sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose，hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks，crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_584 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 日式3D渲染2D · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：electric blue, black, orange accent。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 3D 渲染，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (Japanese cel shaded 3D action render:1.3), (sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose:1.18), (hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks:1.1), crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 日式3D渲染2D 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_585 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 日式3D渲染2D · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n日式3D渲染2D，Japanese cel shaded 3D action render，sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose，hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks，crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (Japanese cel shaded 3D action render:1.3), (sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose:1.18), (hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks:1.1), crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“3D 渲染”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_586 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 日式3D渲染2D · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 日式3D渲染2D 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 日式3D渲染2D 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | Japanese cel shaded 3D action render; sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose; crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups |\n| 光影 | hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 日式3D渲染2D 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_587 = "# 全局美学基础 · 日式3D渲染2D\n\n---\n必须严格、完整遵循下方全部风格约束与全局规则，并严格按提示词模板格式生成提示词；仅输出提示词正文，不得附加任何解释、说明、注释、标题或其他额外文本。\n\n## 一、风格基因\n\n| 维度 | 定义 |\n|---|---|\n| 一级风格 | 日式3D渲染2D |\n| 媒介类型 | 3D 渲染 |\n| 核心锚点 | Japanese cel shaded 3D action render |\n| 视觉要点 | sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose |\n| 情绪基调 | 日式三渲二通用风格，强调动态姿态、锐利赛璐璐阴影和强镜头张力。 |\n| 质感锚词 | crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups |\n\n## 二、全局色彩与光影\n\n| 项目 | 约束 |\n|---|---|\n| 色彩基线 | electric blue, black, orange accent |\n| 主光方案 | hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks |\n| 画面层次 | 主体清晰、前中后景可读、焦点明确 |\n| 质量锚定 | (best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (Japanese cel shaded 3D action render:1.3), (sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose:1.18), (hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks:1.1), crisp toon shader, clear line accents, stylized material breakups, sharp focus, detailed background, polished composition |\n| 反向规避 | (worst quality, low quality, bad quality:1.4), blurry, fuzzy, distorted, out of focus, malformed body, extra limbs, watermark, signature, text, photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness |\n\n## 三、必守规则\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | 必须声明“日式3D渲染2D”和“Japanese cel shaded 3D action render”作为风格锚点 |\n| R2 | 必须保持“3D 渲染”媒介边界，不混入错媒介词 |\n| R3 | 必须包含“sharp anime silhouette, dynamic camera angle, bold costume shapes, action pose”中至少 2 个视觉识别点 |\n| R4 | 必须说明光源或光影方向：hard rim light, high contrast stage lighting, motion streaks |\n| R5 | 必须把质量锚点与主体内容融合，不输出解释性说明 |\n\n## 四、严禁项\n\n| 编号 | 严禁内容 |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | 直接写入具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称 |\n| X2 | photorealistic rendering, dull flat color, western cartoon softness |\n| X3 | 低质量、模糊、变形、裁切、文字、水印、签名 |\n| X4 | 人物身份漂移、服装不一致、手部结构错误、场景空间混乱 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_588 = "# 积木定格动画 通用风格说明\n\n积木定格风格，强调塑料砖块、拼搭世界和玩具摄影感。\n\n## 风格边界\n\n- **媒介类型**：定格动画\n- **核心风格**：brick toy stop-motion animation\n- **视觉要点**：block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props\n- **光影方案**：macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection\n- **质感锚点**：hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges\n- **色彩基线**：primary red, blue, yellow\n\n## 适用范围\n\n- 角色基础形象、角色衍生服化、场景、场景衍生、道具、分镜和视频提示词。\n- 可作为项目默认视觉风格，也可复制到“我的风格”后继续细化。\n- 适合做统一美术基线，不绑定任何具体作品、作者或厂牌。\n\n## 严禁内容\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色的名称与固定造型。\n- 偏离“定格动画”媒介边界的错媒介输出。\n- soft clay, melted curved shapes, realistic human body。\n- 低质量、模糊、裁切、文字水印、结构错误、身份漂移。\n\n## 风格体验\n\n在本风格下，画面应优先呈现“brick toy stop-motion animation”的整体气质，通过“block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props”建立识别度，再用“macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection”控制情绪和镜头完成度。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_589 = "---\nname: art_character\ndescription: 积木定格动画 · 角色基础形象生成\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物基础形象生成 · 积木定格动画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 生成 定格角色设定图，用于角色首次定型。\n- 必须保持“brick toy stop-motion animation”和“定格动画”媒介边界。\n- 人物需具备清晰身份、年龄、性别、五官、体态、发型、基础服装和气质标签。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n{性别}角色四视图设定图，积木定格动画，brick toy stop-motion animation，block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props，\ncharacter design sheet, character turnaround,\n{五官特征}，{整体气质}，{年龄段}，{身份职业}，\n{身高描述}，{头身比}，{体型描述}，{体态描述}，\n{发色发型}，{基础服装}，{服装材质与色彩}，\n同一画面左至右并排：人像特写+正视图+侧视图+后视图，\n人像特写从头顶到锁骨完整展示，全身立像从头顶到脚底完整展示，\nmacro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection，hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges，primary red, blue, yellow，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (brick toy stop-motion animation:1.3), (block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props:1.18), (macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection:1.1), hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges, macro photography, tactile detail, frame-by-frame charm, high detail，\n图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (brick toy stop-motion animation:1.3), (block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props:1.18), (macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection:1.1), hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges, macro photography, tactile detail, frame-by-frame charm, high detail\n角色类提示词必须保留身份、年龄、性别、五官、身高、头身比、体态、服装、发型和四视图一致性。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), fluid CGI animation, 2D anime, photorealistic human scale, smooth digital texture, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, soft clay, melted curved shapes, realistic human body, bad anatomy, deformed face, asymmetrical eyes, extra limbs, missing limbs, fused fingers, cropped head, cropped feet, inconsistent identity, inconsistent clothing.\n\n## 四、必守 / 严禁\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 四视图同一人物，面容/体型/发型/服装/光影完全一致 |\n| 必守 | 全身从头到脚完整入画，特写从头顶到锁骨完整入画 |\n| 严禁 | 直接套用具体作品角色造型或版权角色名称 |\n| 严禁 | soft clay, melted curved shapes, realistic human body |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_590 = "---\nname: art_character_derivative\ndescription: 积木定格动画 · 角色衍生服化\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 人物衍生生成 · 积木定格动画\n\n## 一、基础原则\n\n- 以角色基础形象为底图，只叠加服装、妆造、配饰、状态和局部风格强化。\n- 不改变底模面容、身高、头身比、体态和核心身份。\n\n## 二、提示词模板\n\n以角色基础形象图为底图，img2img 叠加服化妆造，\n积木定格动画，brick toy stop-motion animation，保持基础形象面容不变，保持同一人物身份，\n{妆容/面部状态}，{发型变化}，{服饰款式}，{配饰与材质}，\nblock figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props，macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection，hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges，\n四视图一致性，保持自然站立，背景简洁，\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (brick toy stop-motion animation:1.3), (block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props:1.18), (macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection:1.1), hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges, macro photography, tactile detail, frame-by-frame charm, high detail，图中不要有任何文字\n\n## 三、提示词质量增强\n\n### 正向质量锚点\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (brick toy stop-motion animation:1.3), (block figure, construction bricks, modular toy town, snapped-together props:1.18), (macro toy light, crisp shadow, colorful plastic reflection:1.1), hard plastic brick surface, molded studs, clean toy edges, macro photography, tactile detail, frame-by-frame charm, high detail\n人物衍生提示词必须保持底模面容、体态、发型识别点不变，只叠加服化妆造与局部风格升级。\n\n### 反向规避提示词\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), fluid CGI animation, 2D anime, photorealistic human scale, smooth digital texture, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, soft clay, melted curved shapes, realistic human body, face drift, identity changed, different person, pose changed, added unrelated scene, inconsistent costume between views, cropped body.\n\n## 四、约束规则\n\n| 类型 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| 必守 | 叠加后仍是同一人物，不改变底模身份 |\n| 必守 | 衍生内容只改变服化妆造、状态和局部风格强度 |\n| 严禁 | 把人物改成其他作品、其他画风或其他媒介 |\n| 严禁 | soft clay, melted curved shapes, realistic human body |\n";
