const __vite_glob_0_619 = "---\nname: art_storyboard_video\ndescription: 真人古装 · 视频提示词约束\nmetaData: art_skills\n---\n\n# 视频提示词 · 真人古装\n\n生成视频提示词时，必须注入以下视觉风格标签：\n\n| 模式 | 风格标签 |\n|---|---|\n| 通用多参模式（英文） | `live-action Chinese period drama still, period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture, soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze, real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture, real lens optics, natural skin texture, cinematic framing, high detail` |\n| 通用首尾帧模式（英文） | `live-action Chinese period drama still, stable first frame and last frame, temporal continuity, soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze, real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture` |\n| 中文模式 | `真人古装，period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture，soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze，real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture，画面连续，主体稳定` |\n\n## 视频特有约束\n\n| 编号 | 规则 |\n|---|---|\n| V1 | 保持主体身份、服装、场景和光影连续 |\n| V2 | 镜头运动服务叙事，不为了炫技改变风格 |\n| V3 | 动作需有起承转合，避免瞬间变形和身份漂移 |\n| V4 | 首尾帧构图保持稳定，过渡自然 |\n| V5 | 负向规避：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3D render, CGI, anime, illustration, cartoon, plastic skin, over-smoothed face, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime, flicker, jitter, morphing face, identity drift, warped hands, broken motion, sudden scene jump |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_620 = "---\nname: director_planning_style\ndescription: 真人古装 · 导演规划技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 导演规划 · 真人古装\n\n## 一、色调体系\n\n- **色彩基线**：ivory, red lacquer, warm gold。\n- **情绪绑定**：温柔段落降低对比，冲突段落强化明暗，高潮段落提高主体边缘光。\n- **禁用色域**：modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime。\n\n## 二、光影方案\n\n- **主光方案**：soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze。\n- **层次原则**：主体、背景和道具要有明确层次，不允许画面糊成一片。\n- **媒介边界**：全片保持 真人摄影，不混入错媒介词。\n\n## 三、质感方向\n\n- **质感锚点**：real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture。\n- **提示词基线**：(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (live-action Chinese period drama still:1.3), (period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture:1.18), (soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze:1.1), real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture, real lens optics, natural skin texture, cinematic framing, high detail。\n- **反向规避**：(worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3D render, CGI, anime, illustration, cartoon, plastic skin, over-smoothed face, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime。\n\n## 四、段落规划\n\n| 段落类型 | 视觉策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 开场 | 用代表性场景建立 真人古装 的风格基线 |\n| 人物登场 | 强化主体轮廓、服饰/材质和面部识别点 |\n| 冲突段落 | 增强构图张力和光影对比，但不破坏身份连续 |\n| 收束段落 | 减少复杂元素，回到清晰、稳定、可延续的视觉基线 |\n";
const __vite_glob_0_621 = "---\nname: director_storyboard\ndescription: 真人古装 · 导演分镜提示词技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜提示词 · 真人古装\n\n## 固定风格锚定词\n\n真人古装，live-action Chinese period drama still，period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture，soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze，real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture\n\n## 情绪到画面词映射\n\n| 情绪 | 面容/主体 | 光影 | 镜头建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 温柔 | 目光柔和、动作克制 | soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze 的柔化版本 | 中近景，缓慢推近 |\n| 紧张 | 表情收紧、主体轮廓明确 | 对比增强、暗部加深 | 低角度或侧逆光 |\n| 释然 | 姿态放松、背景打开 | 主光回暖、空气感增强 | 远景到中景过渡 |\n| 爆发 | 动作明确、重心前压 | 强轮廓光、动势线强化 | 动态构图但不破坏识别 |\n\n## 画质锁定词\n\n(best quality, masterpiece, high detailed:1.2), (live-action Chinese period drama still:1.3), (period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture:1.18), (soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze:1.1), real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture, real lens optics, natural skin texture, cinematic framing, high detail\n\n## 负向词模板\n\n(worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3D render, CGI, anime, illustration, cartoon, plastic skin, over-smoothed face, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime, subtitles, captions, watermark, title overlay, UI text\n\n## 禁止项\n\n- 直接照搬具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色。\n- modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime。\n- 让镜头语言破坏“真人摄影”的媒介边界。\n";
const __vite_glob_0_622 = "---\nname: director_storyboard_table_style\ndescription: 真人古装 · 分镜表技法\nmetaData: director_skills\n---\n\n# 分镜表设计 · 真人古装\n\n## 一、分镜表定位\n\n分镜表负责把剧本转为镜头语言，本文件限定 真人古装 在镜头、光影、材质和连续性上的写法。\n\n## 二、镜头字段规则\n\n| 字段 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 画面描述 | 必须含主体、动作、空间、光影和 真人古装 风格锚点 |\n| 风格提示词 | live-action Chinese period drama still; period costume, embroidered fabric, ancient interior, elegant posture; real silk folds, hair ornament detail, natural skin texture |\n| 光影 | soft lantern light, daylight through lattice, cinematic haze |\n| 负向规避 | (worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3D render, CGI, anime, illustration, cartoon, plastic skin, over-smoothed face, bad anatomy, watermark, signature, text, modern clothes, glasses, watch, 3D render, anime |\n| 连续性 | 人物身份、服装、场景结构、道具位置必须跨镜头一致 |\n\n## 三、运镜建议\n\n- 角色镜头优先保持主体清楚，避免镜头运动遮挡身份识别点。\n- 场景镜头优先体现前中后景，给后续视频生成留出空间。\n- 动作镜头要写清起点、过程、落点，避免模型自行补出不相关动作。\n\n## 四、硬禁忌\n\n- 不写具体作品、作者、厂牌或版权角色名称。\n- 不把 真人古装 混成其他媒介。\n- 不输出水印、字幕、标题叠字、UI 元素。\n";
